<title>JAPAN: Nippon Lace ask-only after 3rd-party cancellation.</title>
<headline>Nippon Lace ask-only after 3rd-party cancellation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Lace Co Ltd shares were ask-only in early Wednesday trade due to the firm's announcement on Tuesday that it was cancelling its third-party share allocation, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0039 GMT, the shares were ask-only at 291 yen, after closing at 306 on the previous day.  </p>
<p>The company said in February that it would issue six million new shares at 590 yen per share in a third-party allocation.</p>
</text>
